  "html": "<div id=\"step-q155031\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q155031\" questionid=\"155031\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 2</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155031\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Which of the diagrams above shows three collinear points?</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-155031-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">III only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-155031-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">I and II only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-155031-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">II only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-155031-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">I and III only</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-155031-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">I only</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.</p>\n<p>With that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram I shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-155031-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155031-e-0\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram II shows three points that are <em>not</em> collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-155031-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155031-e-1\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram III shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-155031-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-155031-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
